        "id": 1124848
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-08-15T13:06:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I will look into passing perf_event, but AFAICS we\u0027re trying to determine if the configuration (attr) passes the LSM check so attr makes sense than passing in the whole perf_event_open.",
      "parentUuid": "57510651_169190bc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6943,
